            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper describes 6 cases of the rare disease - primary and secondary hypophysitis detected by a morphological examination of the material of endoscopic transsphenoidal resection of pituitary neoplasms. It also provides clinical and morphological comparisons and analyzes the data available in the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
